text Naranja_Islas_G17_M01_Text_081A0C42 {
    "{PLAYER}{KUN}, welcome!\pWhat can I do for you?"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G17_M01_Text_081C5EC6 {
    "Hello!\pThis is the PRETTY PETAL flower shop.\nSpreading flowers throughout the world!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G17_M01_Text_081C5F1B {
    "{PLAYER}{KUN}, would you like to learn about\nBERRIES?"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G17_M01_Text_081C5F48 {
    "Your name is?\p{PLAYER}{KUN}.\nThat’s a nice name.\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, would you like to learn about\nBERRIES?"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G17_M01_Text_081C5F9D {
    "BERRIES grow on trees that thrive\nonly in dark, loamy soil.\pIf you take some BERRIES, be sure to\nplant one in the loamy soil again.\pA planted BERRY will soon sprout,\ngrow into a plant, flower beautifully,\lthen grow BERRIES again.\pI want to see the whole wide world\nfilled with beautiful flowers.\lThat’s my dream.\pPlease help me, {PLAYER}{KUN}. Plant BERRIES\nand bring more flowers into the world."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G17_M01_Text_081C6121 {
    "Flowers bring so much happiness to\npeople, don’t they?"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G17_M01_Text_081C6158 {
    "Hello!\pThe more attention you give to flowers,\nthe more beautifully they bloom.\pYou’ll like tending flowers. I’m sure\nof it. You can have this."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G17_M01_Text_081C61E8 {
    "While BERRY plants are growing,\nwater them with the WAILMER PAIL.\pOh, another thing.\pIf you don’t pick BERRIES for a while,\nthey’ll drop off onto the ground.\lBut they’ll sprout again.\pIsn’t that awesome?\nIt’s like they have the will to live."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G17_M01_Text_081C62DA {
    "I’m trying to be like my big sisters.\nI’m growing flowers, too!\pHere you go! It’s for you!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G17_M01_Text_081C6335 {
    "You can plant a BERRY and grow it big,\nor you can make a POKéMON hold it.\pBut now they have a machine that mixes\nup different BERRIES and makes candies\lfor POKéMON.\pI want some candy, too."
}
